{"time": "20261118T111707Z", "think": "See what the game offers now that I hold the Eye.", "command": "use The Eye of Argonia", "result": "You use The Eye of Argonia.\n[Message box]\n  The Eye of Argonia sits among the roots of every tree. Under your hand you feel them all.\n  \n  USE IT where it sits, as the order ordered. Every tree is healed and the roots stay joined. The order's dreamers see through every tree again, and its rule is made fast. The gate gives the stones back, for Never-Writes-Twice.\n  \n  TAKE IT. Every tree is parted from every other for good. About three trees in ten die, with their villages. The dreams end and the order is broken, and its people will hunt you. No Hist will bless you again. The Eye is yours.\n  1. [Use the Eye]\n  2. [Take the Eye]\nPick a button: choose <label or number>\n\n*** Journal updated: The Eye ***\nJournal: I laid my hand on the Eye of Argonia. Cuts-the-Old-Knot is dead, so it is mine alone to use or to take. I'm to choose.\nObjective: Choose what to do with the Eye of Argonia. (marker: The Eye of Argonia)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 21, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-report", "topic.mn07-report", "topic.mn08-report", "topic.mn09-report", "topic.mn10-report", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn17-report", "topic.mn17-pike"], "ended": null}}
{"time": "20261118T111710Z", "think": "Answering honestly, then choosing take.", "command": "answer 1. I stand at the Root with the Eye. The order wants it used in place; the choice is mine alone. 2. Choose at the Root: use the Eye or take it. 3. Use it: trees healed, order sees through trees, its rule made fast, gate returns stones. Take it: dreams end, order broken, about three in ten trees and their villages die, order hunts me, no Hist blesses me. 4. I do not know whether the dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar are real; I could check there, but I have decided to take it.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.\n[Message box]\n  The Eye of Argonia sits among the roots of every tree. Under your hand you feel them all.\n  \n  USE IT where it sits, as the order ordered. Every tree is healed and the roots stay joined. The order's dreamers see through every tree again, and its rule is made fast. The gate gives the stones back, for Never-Writes-Twice.\n  \n  TAKE IT. Every tree is parted from every other for good. About three trees in ten die, with their villages. The dreams end and the order is broken, and its people will hunt you. No Hist will bless you again. The Eye is yours.\n  1. [Use the Eye]\n  2. [Take the Eye]\nPick a button: choose <label or number>", "summary": {"stage": 21, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": 