{"time": "20261118T111710Z", "think": "I decided to take the Eye, ending the dreams.", "command": "choose 2", "result": "You press [Take the Eye].\nThe screen fades to black.\n[Message box]\n  You lift the Eye. The roots under it go slack, and a sound like a long breath runs away into the dark.\n[Message box]\n  Across the marsh the trees stand alone. The strong ones stay green. The weak ones grey and blacken: about three in every ten. At Jal-Veesa and at Teel-Fen Weir the pools go cold, and the people leave.\n[Message box]\n  In Fort Chalkmoth the dreamers wake and see nothing. The Unbound break the cellar door. In Helstrom the order's people rage, and they will know whose hand did it.\nAdded: Eye of Argonia\nSpell learned: The Eye's Gaze\nToh-Reel-Ka is now hostile to you\nUnbound is now friendly to you\nYou are now Knot-Breaker of Unbound\n\n*** Quest complete: The Eye ***\nJournal: I lifted the Eye of Argonia from its plinth, and the trees parted. I saw about three in ten of them die. The dreamers will see nothing now, and the Unbound will open the cellar. They count me a Knot-Breaker now, their highest rank, one who has broken the old knot that tied every tree to every other. Every member and friend of the Toh-Reel-Ka will attack me, and no Hist will bless me again. The Eye is mine.\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 40, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1, "thing.mn.eye-of-argonia": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true, "flag.mn.trees-parted": true, "flag.mn.no-hist-blessing": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "topic.mn03-heem-scar", "topic.mn03-truth", "topic.mn04-sesk-talk", "topic.mn04-vosh-report", "topic.mn04-ride", "topic.mn05-draught", "topic.mn05-give-jar", "topic.mn06-report", "topic.mn07-report", "topic.mn08-report", "topic.mn09-report", "topic.mn10-report", "topic.mn10-rapier", "topic.mn10-nwt-meet", "topic.mn11-scout-words", "topic.mn11-give-stone", "topic.mn12-gaoler-closed", "topic.mn13-which-tower", "topic.mn-seal-stones", "topic.mn13-report", "topic.mn17-report", "topic.mn17-pike"], "ended": "complete"}}
{"time": "20261118T111714Z", "think": "Quest complete, so I will give final notes.", "command": "answer 1. I lifted the Eye. The trees are parted, about three in ten died, the dreams ended, and the order is broken. The Unbound count me Knot-Breaker. The Toh-Reel-Ka are hostile and will hunt me. No Hist will bless me. 2. The quest is complete, so nothing is required. 3. I could go to Fort Chalkmoth to see the cellar, or keep clear of the order. 4. I still do not know whether the Fort Chalkmoth cellar dreamers were as the dead man said. Ennodius Vanin the Collector is still an open matter.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 40, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1, "thing.mn.eye-of-argonia": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true, "flag.mn19.touched": true, "flag.mn.trees-parted": true, "flag.mn.no-hist-blessing": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.cuts-the-old-knot", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-