{"time": "20261118T111718Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I lifted the Eye of Argonia at the Root. The trees are parted for good. About three in ten died, and Jal-Veesa and Teel-Fen Weir were abandoned. The dreams have ended and the order is broken. The Unbound are friendly and call me Knot-Breaker. The Toh-Reel-Ka are hostile and will hunt me, and no Hist will bless me. The Unbound broke open the Fort Chalkmoth cellar. I had not verified that myself, and I did not go there. I learned the spell The Eyes Gaze. I carry the Eye, 1650 gold, the rapier, the Order-Pike, the Eye-Setting, the Keystone, the Bronze-Key, paralysis poison x3 and two lockpicks. Cuts-the-Old-Knot showed as present at the Root but would not speak to me. Still open: Fort Chalkmoth key and cellar, and Ennodius Vanin the Collector. The three seal-stones stay in the gate. I did not loot the hydras treasure.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 40, "at": "The Root", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1, "thing.mn19.eye-plinth": 1, "thing.mn.eye-of-argonia": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.jars-seen": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": t